.TH SINKD 1
.SH NAME
sinkd \- watch folders and sync them to a sinkd hub
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sinkd
[\fIoptions\fR]
.br
.B sinkd pair
.I host
[\fIoptions\fR]
.br
.B sinkd stop
.br
.B sinkd reload
.br
.B sinkd ssh
.I user@host:/path/
.B \-\-anchor
.I path
[\fB\-\-delete\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sinkd
watches folders on this machine and keeps them in step with a
.B sinkd-srv
hub.
With no subcommand it runs in the foreground until Ctrl-C.
The hub address comes from
.BR \-\-server ,
from
.IR client.toml ,
or from the last successful
.BR pair .
A folder still has to be named with
.B \-\-anchor
or in
.IR client.toml .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " path"
Use this config file instead of the default.
.TP
.BI \-\-state-dir " path"
Keys, the remembered hub, and sync state. Default
.IR ~/.local/state/sinkd ,
or
.BR SINKD_STATE_DIR .
.TP
.BI \-\-runtime-dir " path"
Directory for the control socket. Default
.BR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR .
.TP
.BI \-\-server " host"
Hub hostname or IP. Implies run when no subcommand is given.
.TP
.BI \-\-anchor " path"
Folder to watch. Repeat for more than one. Personal tree on the hub, one copy per user.
.TP
.BI \-\-share " path"
Folder shared as one tree for every client. Repeat for more than one.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI pair " host"
Exchange keys with the hub at
.IR host .
The hub prints a 6-digit code; type it when asked.
.B \-\-code
supplies the code without a prompt.
.B \-\-pair-port
overrides port 7449.
.TP
.B stop
Ask the running
.B sinkd
to exit.
.TP
.B reload
Ask the running
.B sinkd
to reload. New folders are not picked up yet; stop it and start it again.
.TP
.BI ssh " user@host:/path/"
One libreflect copy over SSH. Does not pair, watch, or use the hub.
.B \-\-anchor
is the local folder.
.B \-\-delete
removes files at the destination that are gone locally.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sinkd/client.toml
Optional server, anchors, and shares. Flags override the file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sinkd/
Keys and the remembered hub.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sinkd/conflicts/
Edits set aside when the hub won.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sinkd-srv (1)
